  "reason": "The strongest evidence so far is that multiprofile PCA RNA with avgpool aggregation and weighted multimodal fusion using ResNet50 gives the best validation accuracy and F1, while image-only ResNet50 is weak and ViT is untested. This experiment tests whether replacing the image encoder with imagenet_vit_l improves the current best multimodal setup while keeping profile setting, RNA encoder, aggregation, and fusion fixed. It is the best next use of budget because it exploits the most promising configuration, isolates the effect of image representation, and clarifies whether the current gain comes from fusion generally or from a stronger visual encoder."
}

